<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-combat-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Back for Combat Rogue DPS</span></h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69884/mistral-drape">
<img alt="Mistral Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mistral Drape</span></a> <span class="q4">of the Zephyr</span> will be our new pre-raid bis coming from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=232955/satchel-of-the-mistral-drape">
<img alt="Satchel of the Mistral Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Satchel of the Mistral Drape</span></a> for 28 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>. You'll have a 1/<wbr/>4 chance of getting the appropriate affix that we want, but any variation will be better than the 2nd best option in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71268/mantle-of-doubt">
<img alt="Mantle of Doubt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_firelands_fireset_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of Doubt</span></a>. This items comes from the new quest in Rage of The Firelands, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="quest" data-game="wow" data-type="quest" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/quest=29331/elemental-bonds-the-vow">
<img alt="Elemental Bonds: The Vow" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elemental Bonds: The Vow</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=44457/enchant-cloak-major-agility">
<img alt="Enchant Cloak - Major Agility" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Major Agility</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=75178/swordguard-embroidery">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Swordguard Embroidery</span></a> if you have chosen tailoring.<div class="pad"></div>
