<span class="c4">Hands for Combat Rogue DPS</span></h4>We now have 2 solid pre-bis options in either the crafted <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69942/clutches-of-evil">
