<img alt="Dark Phoenix Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_leather_raidrogue_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Phoenix Gloves</span></a> costing 1650 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
