<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-combat-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Waist for Combat Rogue DPS</span></h4>We can now acquire the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60231/belt-of-the-fallen-brood">
<img alt="Belt of the Fallen Brood" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_leatherraidrogue_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Fallen Brood</span></a> for 80 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> making this easily our pre-bis option at 379 item level! We can also grab either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71640/riplimbs-lost-collar">
<img alt="Riplimb's Lost Collar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_leather_raidrogue_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Riplimb's Lost Collar</span></a> as a BoE from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65371/wind-stalker-belt">
<img alt="Wind Stalker Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_leatherraidrogue_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wind Stalker Belt</span></a> <span class="q4">of the Zephyr</span> by gambling 28 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=232973/satchel-of-the-wind-stalker-belt">
<img alt="Satchel of the Wind Stalker Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Satchel of the Wind Stalker Belt</span></a>. All in all, you'll save up for the guaranteed Sinestra belt and be more than happy with that.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Belt Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55054/ebonsteel-belt-buckle">
<img alt="Ebonsteel Belt Buckle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ebonsteel Belt Buckle</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=55016/nitro-boosts">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a>
