<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">
<span class="c4">Weapons for Combat Rogue DPS</span></h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-combat-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Main Hand Weapons for Combat Rogue DPS</span></h4>We now have a wide selection of Main-Hand weapons. You can look to get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68129/stormwake-the-tempests-reach">
<img alt="Stormwake, the Tempest's Reach" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_1h_bwdraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormwake, the Tempest's Reach</span></a> <span class="q4">of the Zephyr</span> from Protocol Inferno Dungeon, as well as the pickpocketed item <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68161/krol-decapitator">
<img alt="Krol Decapitator" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Krol Decapitator</span></a>, and the couple of options from ZA/<wbr/>ZG. Ideally, you'll just look to grab whichever 359 choice you can get your hands on first.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52776/enchant-weapon-landslide">
<img alt="Enchant Weapon - Landslide" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Landslide</span></a>. Your main-hand poison will be <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=6947/instant-poison">
<img alt="Instant Poison" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_poisons.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Instant Poison</span></a>
